  "prefLabel": "He-W 856.07 Resource Disregard",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 856.07 Resource Disregard. For individuals ages 18 or older applying for or receiving nursing facility services or choices for independent (HCBS-CFI), developmental disability (HCBS-DD), acquired brain disorder (HCBS-ABD), or in home supports (HCBS-IHS) waiver services under the home and community-based services, a disregard shall be applied in the amount between the base resource standard for the group and $7,500.\n\nSource. #14378, eff 9-20-25, EXPIRES: 9-20-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-w800.html"
}
